cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: SynthSeg Brain Segmentation
abstract: Whole-brain segmentation of T1-weighted MRI with SynthSeg 2.0, which works on scans of any contrast
  and resolution. Writes a FreeSurfer-labelled segmentation, per-subject and cohort volume tables and
  automated QC scores.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
